e/recover password; Settings/theme/logout. Equipment roles: own notices where permitted.
* Engineer/Architect interruptions require installed cancellation gateway, exact ownership/state and server allowedActions.
Tool Handler equipment UI is read-only; base DB metadata privileges are broader. Admin is not a named-receiver substitute.
Source verified; production NEEDS VERIFICATION. Review 20 October 2026." style="text;html=0;fontSize=15;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1080" width="1520" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>